<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" align="center" class="tborder" style="border-bottom: 0;">
	<tr class="titlebg">
		<td valign="middle" align="left" width="15%" style="padding-left: 6px;">
			<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/topic/veryhot_post.gif" alt="" />
			Author
		</td>
		<td valign="middle" align="left" width="85%" style="padding-left: 6px;">
			Topic: LDON drama 4 j00 &nbsp;(Read 1826 times)
		</td>
	</tr>
</table>
<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="bordercolor">
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=744" title="View the profile of zigak">zigak</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 13<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=744"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=980.msg9686#msg9686"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=980.msg9686#msg9686">LDON drama 4 j00</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b> on:</b> August 03, 2004, 03:30:36 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							(Screenshots, taken down I&#039;m tired of hosting them.&nbsp; If you really want to see them PM me.)<br /><br />I try and stay out of BoT, and easy LDON&#039;s but I was bored and decided to play my bard.&nbsp; I get invited to a group doing an easy ldon and figure what the hell.&nbsp; Well we get to the zone line of the EF LDON , here is the screen shot of the text at the start of the adventure (didn&#039;t have logs on).&nbsp; (just got a new UI and hadn&#039;t configured it all the way yet, so forgive the spam). <br /><br /><img src="http://home.cablelynx.com/~chadwick/ldon1.JPG" alt="" border="0" /><br />I knew I was in trouble when Salynyans was asking the Paladin for virtue, knowing he was a paladin.&nbsp; Not to mention anyone 65+ should know that symbol/9/Fo7/brells &gt; Virtue/Fo7/brells (except for pallys) even if you don&#039;t raid 24/7 it is pretty common knowledge.&nbsp; &nbsp;During this I&#039;m thinking to myself maybe this isn&#039;t such a good idea, but I had already commited to the group and figured what the hell.&nbsp; &nbsp;Buffing is obviously over, and they are talking about pally symbols,&nbsp; I wait a minute and just zone in and pull one that is in the first room and proceed to slow it and engage (I could have easily soloed it without even using any songs).&nbsp; <br /><br /><img src="http://home.cablelynx.com/~chadwick/ldon2.JPG" alt="" border="0" /><br />So I&#039;m basically soloing this mob, and they finally decide to zone in after realising that the pally has no dots.&nbsp; People still asking for symbol though, which the pally could cast...if he had some dots.&nbsp; <br /><br />I was chain pulling basically,&nbsp; once the mob got down <br /><br />to about 50% I would go grab another one and mez the one I brought,&nbsp; we didn&#039;t have a slower and the druid/ranger/wizard for some reason were rarely rooting the extra mob, it was just easier for me to mez the extra one I brought to camp if the first one wasn&#039;t dead. Normally in an easy LDON, if&nbsp; the group I was in wasn&#039;t rushing rooms, I would be pulling close to 5 mobs at a time usually the root classes would root the adds as soon as I arrived with them in camp, or engage them, any leather or better class would grab one and we would just proceed to kill them all, hell I have even been in groups that used an AE easy LDON strat.<br /><br /><img src="http://home.cablelynx.com/~chadwick/ldon3.JPG" alt="" border="0" /><br />Finally the fucking Ranger decides to root something.&nbsp; I&#039;m going about my chain pulling,&nbsp; I get a failure on a lull and 3 mobs come.&nbsp; So I need to decide to fade, or bring these 3 relatively easy mobs to camp.&nbsp; I decide to fade because I really don&#039;t trust the healer and I know the ranger only roots when the mood strikes him.&nbsp; I turn around to get a little distance before I fade and BAM there is the freaken wizard Salnyans,&nbsp; he had moved up all by himself&nbsp; and decided to keep me company.&nbsp; No biggie I thought to myself,&nbsp; we should be able to handle 3 mobs,&nbsp; I could have stayed faded but I didn&#039;t want the wizard to get the aggro and possibly die (the group was a couple rooms back) so I quickly cast my slow which drops the invis/fade.&nbsp; <br /><br />I get to camp, all the mobs are on me the MT hasn&#039;t engaged a mob, the ranger is standing their drooling (I thought he might start rooting...but I was wrong).&nbsp; My health drops down to about 50%,&nbsp; then 30%&nbsp; I started getting a little worried I&#039;m getting stunned and my mez is being resisted over and over so I&#039;m getting ready to click DA song, when the druid finally heals me.&nbsp; You know what happens next when someone heals lightly aggroed non-rooted mobs...well of course the mobs start beating on the druid instantly.&nbsp; I&#039;m still trying to mez, the Paladin finally decides to throw some stuns, the wizard decided to overaggro the Pallys target so now the wizard is getting beat on.&nbsp; I finally get the 2 extra adds mezzed,&nbsp; I&#039;m at about 35% health, and the druid/wizard are at 1 bub health..<br /><br />It was just a comedy of erros, and people not being on their toes.&nbsp; If the wizard hadn&#039;t followed me, or my mez&#039;s didn&#039;t get chain resisted it would have been NP.&nbsp; Either way it was no big deal, nobody died and I think a few people actually woke up.<br /><br /><img src="http://home.cablelynx.com/~chadwick/ldon4.JPG" alt="" border="0" /><br />Nothing much to see here.&nbsp; The druid apparently can&#039;t sit and has a crappy mana pool.<br /><br /><img src="http://home.cablelynx.com/~chadwick/ldon5.JPG" alt="" border="0" /><br />I decide next time I will just CC before I get to the camp if fading isn&#039;t an option since 3 mobs nearly cost us a death. I wasn&#039;t rude though, and I didn&#039;t blame anyone, just figured I would try and make the best out of this group.&nbsp; <br /><br />I move up a couple rooms to go pull one at the druids request, and there the wizard is right behind me again.&nbsp; So I ask that he stay back unless he wants us to wipe (the druid hadn&#039;t regained that much mana) Hell I didn&#039;t even mentioned his name in the group, I was trying to be non-confrontational.&nbsp; <br /><br />Well the wizard replys with a smart ass comment, he basically said STFU and pull in more words. Then his ranger friend silverblades makes another comment r/t me almost causing a wipe,&nbsp; when the fucking wizard he was defending was the cause of the measley 3 pull in the first place and he himself couldn&#039;t be bothered to fucking root one of the mobs when they were pouding on the healer.&nbsp; <br /><br />That was it, I had been nice but was through trying to just get along.&nbsp; I made a couple of comments that I felt applyed and just dropped it,&nbsp; going to get through this LDON and go tradeskill or something.&nbsp; Idiot fucking Ranger Silverblades, who can&#039;t even fucking engage one mob makes a comment about what I&#039;m doing.&nbsp; Well...let me tell you what I&#039;m doing,&nbsp; #1 Pulling for this weak ass group #2 Twisting 4 songs, and keeping clicky buffs up on the group on top of that #3 Trying to CC resistant mobs #4 Contributing minor dps via Melee #5 Arguing with your no skill ass. <br />Then another comment about being able to root pull the entire adventure, yet he can&#039;t root a fucking single mob in camp.<br /><br /><img src="http://home.cablelynx.com/~chadwick/ldon6.JPG" alt="" border="0" /><br />I finally loose it, and tell him to just fuck off.&nbsp; The wizard and his ranger friend are fucking idiots.&nbsp; I decide I&#039;m not going to pull this adventure any more,&nbsp; the ranger can pull and I will just stick close to the healer for mana, and CC adds/twist.&nbsp; Well they decide its going to take two of them to pull lol,&nbsp; but I wish them luck anyways, I then get booted from the group.&nbsp; Which believe me was a relief,&nbsp; I wanted to disband but wasn&#039;t going to until the adv was over.&nbsp; <br /><br />Anways just thought I would share my shitty LDON with you all. If I don&#039;t get at least four or five flames directed at me, I&#039;m going to cry.<br /><br /><br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: August 27, 2004, 02:59:01 pm by zigak</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg9687"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=744" title="View the profile of zigak">zigak</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 13<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=744"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=980.msg9687#msg9687"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=980.msg9687#msg9687">Re: LDON drama 4 j00</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #1 on:</b> August 03, 2004, 04:21:29 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							FYI I logged back on and got the failed message, big fucking suprise there&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cool.gif" alt="Cool" border="0" /> .&nbsp; I never post here,&nbsp; but those 2 raging monkey fucks ( salnyans and silverblades) deserved a rant.&nbsp; I have three boxed easy LDON&#039;s quicker without even coming close to death.&nbsp; 
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg9689"></a>
