							&nbsp;you went against your own rule of staying out of normal ldons and got reminded why hehe.    i see faults on both sides and i think you should&#039;ve exercised a little more patience considering you didnt want to be there anyways.  looks to me you zoned in and engaged when druid at 60m possibly explaining his early oom healing you/himself and wizzy(where was the tank lol?).    yes, it was a normal adventure that you guys should&#039;ve ripped through but you can&#039;t ever assume in a pick up group.  we&#039;ve all had our bad ldon&#039;s and i&#039;m sure that wasn&#039;t your first hehe.  anyways hate to see you have bad expirience.
