								<a href="mailto:murgen21@yahoo.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=980.msg9697#msg9697"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=980.msg9697#msg9697">Re: LDON drama 4 j00</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #6 on:</b> August 03, 2004, 01:41:57 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							*shrug* sounds like a crappy group, but you did basically mock them for not being able to handle your usual pulls of 4-5 at a time, which wasn&#039;t cool.&nbsp; If you take a pickup ldon normal group, you should assume that they may not be able to handle 4-5 mobs at a time.&nbsp; They aren&#039;t trivial as hell mobs for everyone.&nbsp; There&#039;s no reason to complain about that.&nbsp; Of course ya never brought them more than 3 and there definitely was some stupidity on their parts.<br /><br />I&#039;m surprised ya had trouble with mez resists on that 3 pull, but it happens.&nbsp; You were probably surprised too.&nbsp; &nbsp; 
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
