	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg9699"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=744" title="View the profile of zigak">zigak</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 13<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=744"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=980.msg9699#msg9699"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=980.msg9699#msg9699">Re: LDON drama 4 j00</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #7 on:</b> August 03, 2004, 02:29:27 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Believe me, I&#039;m not claiming to be super bard shitting uber bricks for all the lowbies to pick up.&nbsp; Hell later that night I took a hard LDON and wiped the group due to some proximity aggro I didn&#039;t notice in one room, thought I had one mob but then another came shortly after, and after that another healer/MT was dead before the cast time ended on my first mez lol.&nbsp; Just had a bad night all together.&nbsp; So I&#039;m far from perfect.&nbsp; <br /><br />I&#039;ve grouped with tons of lesser equipped characters (hell I only have 5200 hp, I&#039;m not uber).&nbsp; I wasn&#039;t making issue of their equipment status,&nbsp; one bazaar/LDON equipped druid I group with on a regular basis is able to heal, dps and back up CC without ever mana starving on an overpull.&nbsp; I was just sort of shocked a 3 pull almost caused several deaths, when I have three boxed easy LDON&#039;s done 4 mob pulls and came out smelling like roses. <br /><br />Equipment does not a good player make,&nbsp; it was almost like no one was putting any effort into it.&nbsp; Hell, if you want to slack go to BoT or something,&nbsp; when doing an LDON the name of the game is do it as fast as possible.&nbsp; They were fucking around at the ZL asking the pally to cast virtue and looking for dots &gt; 10 goddamn minutes.&nbsp; Anyways,&nbsp; I sort of feel bad for posting all that now.&nbsp; Yeah the wizard/ranger sucked pretty bad but I could have posted without the names/screenshots.<br /><br />Kweil, your suggestion is sort of counterproductive lol, especially with the group I had.&nbsp; I&#039;m sure if the wizard died they would absolutely insist that we wait for him to get before proceeding.&nbsp; <br /><br />Daemii,<br />I was prepared to solo the one entrance mob, just to do something while they were trying to figure out how to get a symbol lol.&nbsp; 
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
