						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=980.msg9701#msg9701"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=980.msg9701#msg9701">Re: LDON drama 4 j00</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #8 on:</b> August 03, 2004, 02:37:05 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I&#039;ve killed my fair share of pull followers, the key is to keep pulling and force them to keep killing.&nbsp; I had about 70ish wins with 0 loses before I left.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
