	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg9702"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=748" title="View the profile of Iniquitous">Iniquitous</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 13<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=748"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=980.msg9702#msg9702"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=980.msg9702#msg9702">Re: LDON drama 4 j00</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #9 on:</b> August 03, 2004, 02:37:54 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I heard about this advent, but had not seen a log until this thread.<br /><br />Here are all the facts I really need:<br /><br />1. You zoned in without permission.<br />2. You were mouthy.<br /><br />The wizard wasn&#039;t asking for Virtue he was asking the Paladin if he had the 1100 pt pally buff that he must have been comparing to virtue: Guidance.&nbsp; He even refers to it as the &quot;pally virt spell&quot;.&nbsp; He questions the request for symbol because the -pally- is asking for a symbol when the only person in the group that can cast symbols is the pally.&nbsp; The pally was definitely a newb.&nbsp; Silverblades, and everybody else involved most likely, was expecting a bard to keep all mobs mezzed that weren&#039;t on main tank.&nbsp; You knew at this point that you had a newb tank, and with only a dru healing, I don&#039;t know why you expected anything but single mob fights.<br /><br />From what Silverblades had to say the wizard basically soloed most of the advent root nuking and they still won with plenty of time.<br /><br />What I find most disturbing about your post is that you think it&#039;s OK to zone in without the group&#039;s permission.&nbsp; That&#039;s pretty irresponsible and definitely not something a mature EQ player should be doing.&nbsp; If you&#039;re not leading the encounter, you stay put until told otherwise.<br /><br />That must suck that you got a failure message, since they won the LDON with 30 minutes to spare.<br /><br />-Iniquitous
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: August 03, 2004, 02:47:12 pm by Iniquitous</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg9703"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=148" title="View the profile of Lhyra">Lhyra</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 10<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=148"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=980.msg9703#msg9703"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=980.msg9703#msg9703">Re: LDON drama 4 j00</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #10 on:</b> August 03, 2004, 02:53:14 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Iniquitous, <br /><br />In an easy LDoN mission, is time really an issue?&nbsp; You said yourself without the bard, they finished with 30 min to spare.&nbsp; Was the bard zoning in early really a reason to start off the mission with attitudes?<br /><br />I find it a lot more disturbing the wiz felt the need to follow the puller.&nbsp; Since you seem to know him, why did he do that?&nbsp; He must have had a reason.&nbsp; Even the noob paladin (I love noobs) knew not to follow the puller.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg9704"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=744" title="View the profile of zigak">zigak</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 13<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=744"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=980.msg9704#msg9704"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=980.msg9704#msg9704">Re: LDON drama 4 j00</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #11 on:</b> August 03, 2004, 02:59:09 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Ooh, now its rant material !&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/wiggle2.gif" alt="Wiggle" border="0" /><br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">You zoned in without permission</div><br />After spending a fair amount of time up top waiting for them to sort out whatever they were trying to sort out.&nbsp; It was an easy LDON,&nbsp; they were fucking around.&nbsp; Sometimes you have to take the initiative and just go or you will be sitting there all night. <br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">You were mouthy.</div><br />DId you read the text?&nbsp; I wouldn&#039;t qualify my comments as mouthy.&nbsp; I usually chat alot more and am a much bigger smart ass around my in game friends.<br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">The wizard wasn&#039;t asking for Virtue he was asking the Paladin if he had the 1100 pt pally buff that he must have been comparing to virtue: Guidance.&nbsp; He even refers to it as the &quot;pally virt spell&quot;.&nbsp; He questions the request for symbol because the -pally- is asking for a symbol when the only person in the group that can cast symbols is the pally.</div><br />Whatever,&nbsp; it still took far too long to sort it all out.&nbsp; You all can circle up jerk up top trying to get a symbol from a paladin without dots, meet ya down there....lets see if I can AE kite an LDON. <br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">The pally was definitely a newb.&nbsp; From what Silverblades had to say the wizard basically soloed most of the advent root nuking and they still won with plenty of time.</div><br />Maybe the wizard/ranger finally decided to put forth some fucking effort into the adventure after I got booted, yaay for them.&nbsp; I got the lost message when I logged back in,&nbsp; not sure what the LDON code is for calculating a loss when someone leaves the zone/LD&#039;s since this is the first time I have been booted out of an LDON.&nbsp; &nbsp;<br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">What I find most disturbing about your post is that you think it&#039;s OK to zone in without the group&#039;s permission.&nbsp; That&#039;s pretty irresponsible and definitely not something a mature EQ player should be doing.&nbsp; If you&#039;re not leading the encounter, you stay put until told otherwise.</div><br />I don&#039;t agree with you entirely, and if you would have been there sitting at the zone line with me you might feel differently.&nbsp; If there was any question in my mind at the time that there would have been issue with completing the collect in time I would not have zoned in.&nbsp; This wasn&#039;t a raid on Quarm, it was an easy collect LDON.&nbsp; <br /><br />At one point during the LDON I thought maybe someone was boxing four characters because people were reacting/moving so slow.&nbsp; Yeah, Im a hyperactive bard and I understand not everyone is on their toes at all times...but jesus it was pathetic.<br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg9705"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=485" title="View the profile of Daemii">Daemii</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 29<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								/poke<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=485"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=980.msg9705#msg9705"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=980.msg9705#msg9705">Re: LDON drama 4 j00</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #12 on:</b> August 03, 2004, 03:03:18 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							i screwed up in a hard adv last night :(    24 collect, we had 23, pulled mob &lt; 1 min to go, we get fail message then like 20 secs later he dies and of course he drops number 24.    earlier in adv my phone rings, i mute eq, phone on loudspeaker, i turn to grab my beer and look back at screen and see mob rampaging me, spill beer all over keyboard trying to turn attack off = dead rogue.  the 30-45 secs that it took to rez/rebuff me costed us the win.<br /><br />...they say alcohol kills   <br /><br />/confession off
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
